  "locales": {
    "en": {
      "trackName": "Offline Games All-in-one",
      "description": "Get ready for Offline Games All-in-one: fun for all ages, and a mental workout too! This offline game collection is like an overflowing toy box packed with more than 11 unique minigames. It's designed for classic game enthusiasts, puzzle lovers, and challenge seekers. And the best part? You don't need an internet connection to enjoy it!\n\nRemember Snake on Nokia, Minesweeper on Windows, and Pong on the arcade? Offline Games All-in-one packs 11 timeless games into one app for iPhone, iPad, and Apple Watch—no internet, no sign-up, just open and play. Beautiful design, smooth touch controls: on your commute, at lunch, or before bed, jump in anytime to kill time, train your brain, or relive the classics.\n\n- Minesweeper: Windows 95–style nostalgia: tap to reveal, long-press to flag or mark a question. Beginner, Intermediate, and Advanced boards—logic, luck, and a classic that never gets old.\n- Sudoku: 4×4, 6×6, and 9×9 grids with Easy / Medium / Hard / Expert levels. Notes mode and hints included—no repeats in any row, column, or box. Your calm logic companion.\n- Snake: Guide the snake to eat food and grow longer—don’t hit the walls or yourself! Swipe to steer and chase your high score. How long can you survive?\n- Klotski: Three Kingdoms sliding block puzzle: move pieces so Cao Cao (the 2×2 red block) reaches the bottom exit. Six classic layouts plus random setups—fewer moves means a better score.\n- Number Puzzle: Classic sliding tile puzzle: arrange numbers 1 through N in order with the bottom-right tile empty. Choose 3×3, 4×4, or 5×5 boards—from easy warm-ups to brain-burning challenges—and track your fewest moves.\n- Image Puzzle: Slide tiles to restore the full picture. Built-in gallery plus import your own photos from the album; random image each game keeps every round fresh.\n- Paratrooper: Retro arcade shooter! Rotate the turret, shoot down helicopters and paratroopers, and hold the line. 10 levels—faster choppers and bigger drops as you advance. Tense and addictive.\n- Pong: A retro tribute to Atari Pong: first to 7 points wins. Face the AI, swipe to move your paddle, and enjoy pure arcade table-tennis fun.\n- Link Link: Clear every matching fruit pair; paths may turn at most twice. Sharp eyes and smart routing—clear the board to win. The match classic you’ll keep coming back to.\n- Gomoku: Black vs. white: connect five in any direction to win. Choose your color and AI difficulty from casual to full strength—perfect for a quick match anytime.\n- Go:Chinese scoring rules with 9×9, 13×13, and 19×19 boards. Smart AI, adjustable difficulty and who plays first—from fast beginner games to full-board play.\n- Offline single-player, pure gameplay focus\n- Modern UI with adaptive layouts for iPhone, iPad, and Apple Watch\n- Local high scores, best moves, and times saved on device\n- Multilingual support for players worldwide\n\nDownload Offline Games All-in-one and carry a whole shelf of games in your pocket!\n\nWe respect your privacy—game data stays on your device only.",
      "releaseNotes": "Various bug fixes and improvements",
